(62, 'Consents collected under Google Consent Mode stored in consent types (purposes) for all Google Consent Mode compatible services. Is only stored until consent is documented on the website server.', '', 'real-cookie-banner-forced', 0, 62, 0),
(63, 'Local caching of selection in cookie banner until server documents consent; documentation periodic or at page switches attempted if server is unavailable or overloaded.', '', 'real-cookie-banner', 0, 63, 0),
